The <ansi fg="command">charisma</ansi> stat measures your force of
personality, persuasiveness, and social acumen.

<ansi fg="yellow">Effects: </ansi>

Charisma influences your interactions with NPCs, including
bartering for better prices and persuading others. It can
also affect certain social and deceptive abilities.

Charisma improves through use -- the more you engage in
social interactions and put your personality to work, the
more it grows.

